        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "到底应该啷子正确的一个放药品呢？今天啊，我们也和大家分享几点。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 18.901,
      "end": 24.145,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "储存的温度呢应该适宜，说明书呢会标明药品储存条件和温度，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0353,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0315,
        "sc_delta": 0.0038,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "储存的温度呢，应该适宜。说明书呢，会标明药品储存条件和温度。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 24.309,
      "end": 27.398,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "要严格的执行。比如讲在阴凉处，",
      "score": 0.3402,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6785,
        "sc_logprob": -0.6346,
        "sc_delta": 0.0439,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.451,
